[38;5;16m[48;5;153m ☐ Section 1 [39m[49m

[1m[38;5;231mDoes the module design look right before I move to testing and tooling?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mLooks right, continue[39m
     [38;5;246mApprove the two-layer design, the rule/schema shapes, per-field errors, and the two implied behavior changes.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Drop minLength
     [38;5;246mShip only required() — the single rule the login form actually uses — and add minLength when a form needs it.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m Collect all errors per field
     [38;5;246mInstead of first-failure-wins, run every rule for a field and return an array of messages per field.[39m
  [38;5;246m4. Type something.[39m
